  "description": "What is left before the user's channel can be used: a one-time Google Cloud setup, then a Google sign-in.\n\nThe steps happen in the user's browser, so walk them through one step at a time. Once ready, running\nthe sign-in again connects another channel.\n\nQuota: no YouTube Data API units.",
